{"3973160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crimson Freedom", "steam_appid": 3973160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/6b23e7f1bcc72c7493db35c85e0755c0.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/40d41559d3b71f0e088193bdd3032dba.poster.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/40d41559d3b71f0e088193bdd3032dba.webm?t=1785257327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crimson Freedom is a gripping <strong>real-time strategy</strong> <strong>game </strong>focused on single player experience. Set on 22nd-century Mars, the game follows the epic struggle of ideologies battling for supremacy over the red planet and the future of humanity. With base building, army management, resource systems, compelling campaigns, and strong, distinctive factions, our game delivers the pure RTS experience, enhanced with modern looks and thoughtful innovations. No gimmicks, just the timeless strategy you expect, done right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/9c2cc7d72a0cd8d3c661e67068f3a9ac.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/952be3a50f089028cd176ae3a1d4954b.poster.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/952be3a50f089028cd176ae3a1d4954b.webm?t=1785257327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core experience centers around an <strong>extensive single-player narrative</strong>. Each campaign offers a unique perspective on the <strong>struggle for humanity’s future</strong>. You’re not just building bases and armies, you’re exploring the moral grey area of the red planet, and the <strong>choices and failures of humanity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/89618ee25689de2f2a7c6d6bf0e70791.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/8af24d54ae6dedb5a7acaf8d356957de.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=685 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a richly detailed sci-fi world, <strong>you’ll explore the future of humanity from three unique perspectives</strong>, gradually uncovering the full truth as you progress at your own pace. Crimson Freedom is designed as a love letter to the genre’s foundational mechanics. It features strong, asymmetrical factions - <strong>Red Rebellion, Orbis Concordia and the Ascentx</strong> - each with <strong>unique units, tech, and tactical strengths</strong> that fundamentally alter how you approach every engagement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/8059ef765eae22999261ffecb58da04c.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/518412caf2948c34f307894242d15f60.poster.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/518412caf2948c34f307894242d15f60.webm?t=1785257327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrill of strategic warfare at a more relaxed pace. <strong>Focus on commanding epic battles </strong>and crushing your opponents <strong>without the stress of resource micromanagement or high APM demands</strong>, allowing for a laid-back and enjoyable gaming experience.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/6b23e7f1bcc72c7493db35c85e0755c0.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/40d41559d3b71f0e088193bdd3032dba.poster.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/40d41559d3b71f0e088193bdd3032dba.webm?t=1785257327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crimson Freedom is a gripping <strong>real-time strategy</strong> <strong>game </strong>focused on single player experience. Set on 22nd-century Mars, the game follows the epic struggle of ideologies battling for supremacy over the red planet and the future of humanity. With base building, army management, resource systems, compelling campaigns, and strong, distinctive factions, our game delivers the pure RTS experience, enhanced with modern looks and thoughtful innovations. No gimmicks, just the timeless strategy you expect, done right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/9c2cc7d72a0cd8d3c661e67068f3a9ac.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/952be3a50f089028cd176ae3a1d4954b.poster.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/952be3a50f089028cd176ae3a1d4954b.webm?t=1785257327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The core experience centers around an <strong>extensive single-player narrative</strong>. Each campaign offers a unique perspective on the <strong>struggle for humanity’s future</strong>. You’re not just building bases and armies, you’re exploring the moral grey area of the red planet, and the <strong>choices and failures of humanity</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/89618ee25689de2f2a7c6d6bf0e70791.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3973160/extras/8af24d54ae6dedb5a7acaf8d356957de.avif?t=1785257327\" width=1170 height=685 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a richly detailed sci-fi world, <strong>you’ll explore the future of humanity from three unique perspectives</strong>, gradually uncovering the full truth as you progress at your own pace. C